    "body": "Let $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccccc}1 & 1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 3 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 3\\end{array}\\right]$. Which of the following statements is FALSE?\n\n",
